+
+### Angular Version
+- Angular 21.2 (`package.json`): zoneless by default, Vitest via `@angular/build:unit-test`; no `zone.js` dependency.
+
+### Architecture
+- Standalone components only, no NgModules; routes are eager (`src/app/app.routes.ts`) — fine at this size, lazy-load if the app grows.
+- Flat `src/app/` folder; files named `*.page.ts`, `*.store.ts`, `*.service.ts`.
+
+### Component Design
+- Route components are `*Page` classes with inline templates, `inject()` for DI, `protected readonly` members used by the template (`src/app/cart.page.ts`).
+- Built-in control flow (`@if`, `@for` with `track`) — no `*ngIf`/`*ngFor`.
+- No component sets `OnPush` (gap on v21): add it to new components; see `docs/defaults.md`.
+
+### Forms
+- Typed reactive forms via `FormBuilder.nonNullable.group` (`src/app/checkout.page.ts`).
+
+### State Management
+- Shared state is a root-provided service holding a private `signal`, exposed via `asReadonly()` and `computed()` (`src/app/cart.store.ts`). No NgRx.
+
+### RxJS
+- Used only for HTTP; consumed by a manual `.subscribe({next, error})` (`checkout.page.ts`). Prefer `takeUntilDestroyed()` for new subscriptions.
+
+### API/HTTP
+- One service per resource wrapping `HttpClient` with typed requests (`src/app/order.service.ts`); `provideHttpClient()` with no interceptors. URLs are literal `/api/...` paths.
+
+### Typing
+- `strict` and `strictTemplates` on (`tsconfig.json`); no `any` in app code.
+
+### Testing
+- Vitest specs beside sources (`*.spec.ts`), Playwright e2e with page objects (`e2e/pages/`).
+- Target shape: unit-dense for store/service logic, a thin Playwright layer for the order journey.
+
+### Styling / SSR
+- Single global `src/styles.css`; no SSR or hydration configured.
 
